\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T6cd,\\u003ch1\\u003eSphereVision 3mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGet SphereVision 3mm for immersive LED displays in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers cutting-edge SphereVision solutions. Call us now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e360-degree storytelling. Visible from every angle.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFull-sphere LED globe display for lobbies, museums, and exhibition centrepieces. Custom-moulded triangular modules tessellate into a seamless sphere from 1 to 5 metres diameter. 360-degree content playback with real-time mapping software included.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of SphereVision 3mm and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe SphereVision 3mm has a 3.0mm pixel pitch, meaning pixels are spaced 3mm apart. This allows for high-resolution content, ideal for close viewing in spaces like museums and lobbies where image clarity is critical.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is the SphereVision 3mm installed and what mounting options are available?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIt supports both ceiling and floor stand mounting, providing flexible installation options based on your venue requirements. The modular design eases assembly into seamless spheres ranging from 1 to 5 meters in diameter.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat kind of warranty do you offer for the SphereVision 3mm?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide a standard industry warranty that covers manufacturing defects and performance issues. Specific terms can vary, so we recommend contacting our sales team for detailed warranty information tailored to your project.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the SphereVision 3mm compare to flat LED displays?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUnlike flat displays, SphereVision 3mm offers a full 360-degree spherical viewing experience with triangular tessellation for seamless content wrap. This makes it ideal for immersive storytelling environments not possible with traditional flat screens.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"SphereVision 3mm LED Display - Immersive Visuals Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get SphereVision 3mm for immersive LED displays in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers cutting-edge SphereVision solutions. Call us now!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sph300\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"defa